# A C4 title broken across lines is lost

"<br/>" breaks the line in a C4 title, and the drawing then no longer carries
the text that was asked for. Decoding the escapes must not stop the checker
noticing that.

```mermaid
C4Context
    title Ledger<br/>v2
    Person(customer, "Customer")
    System(ledger, "Ledger")
    Rel(customer, ledger, "Reads")
```
